  84 /// Whether each of `packages` changed since its last tag: a directory of the package holds different files than it did
  85 /// at the tag, or its tracked files have uncommitted changes. An untagged package counts as changed. A change that was
  86 /// made and then reverted leaves the package as it was released, so it is not a change.
  87 ///
